<%- include('../layouts/shop-top', { title: title || '계좌 입금 안내', active: '', showBack: false }) %>

<div class="app-page" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px 80px;">

  <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:32px;">
    <div style="font-size:48px;margin-bottom:12px;">🏦</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;">계좌 입금 안내</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted,#888);font-size:14px;">
      주문이 접수되었습니다. 아래 계좌로 입금해 주세요.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- 주문 정보 -->
  <div class="app-card" style="background:var(--color-surface,#fff);border:1px solid var(--color-border,#e5e7eb);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;">주문 정보</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border,#e5e7eb);">
      <span style="color:var(--color-text-muted,#888);font-size:14px;">주문번호</span>
      <span style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px;font-family:monospace;"><%= order.order_number %></span>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;">
      <span style="color:var(--color-text-muted,#888);font-size:14px;">결제 금액</span>
      <span style="font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:var(--color-primary,#2563eb);">
        <%= Number(order.total_amount || 0).toLocaleString() %>원
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 계좌 정보 -->
  <div class="app-card" style="background:var(--color-surface,#fff);border:2px solid var(--color-primary,#2563eb);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px;color:var(--color-primary,#2563eb);">입금 계좌 정보</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border,#e5e7eb);">
      <span style="color:var(--color-text-muted,#888);font-size:14px;">은행</span>
      <span style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px;"><%= bankName %></span>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border,#e5e7eb);">
      <span style="color:var(--color-text-muted,#888);font-size:14px;">계좌번호</span>
      <span style="font-weight:700;font-size:16px;font-family:monospace;letter-spacing:0.5px;"><%= bankAccount %></span>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0;">
      <span style="color:var(--color-text-muted,#888);font-size:14px;">예금주</span>
      <span style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px;"><%= bankHolder %></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 안내 사항 -->
  <div style="background:var(--color-surface-alt,#f8fafc);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-text-muted,#666);line-height:1.7;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text,#222);">입금 안내</p>
    <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;">
      <li>입금 기한: 주문 후 <strong>3 영업일</strong> 이내</li>
      <li>입금 확인 후 주문이 처리됩니다.</li>
      <li>입금자명과 주문자명이 다를 경우 고객센터로 문의해 주세요.</li>
      <li>기한 내 미입금 시 주문이 자동 취소될 수 있습니다.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- 버튼 -->
  <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;">
    <a href="/shop" class="app-btn app-btn--outline" style="flex:1;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">
      쇼핑 계속하기
    </a>
    <a href="/shop/account/orders" class="app-btn app-btn--primary" style="flex:1;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;">
      주문 내역 보기
    </a>
  </div>

</div>

<%- include('../layouts/shop-bottom') %>
